  "findings": [
    "In walk first-person, depth visibility consumes 1951.217 ms of 8129.817 ms sample weight; 1900.424 ms (97.4% of depth cost) is below DrawLabels.",
    "In freeflight, depth visibility consumes 1012.037 ms; 991.922 ms (98.0%) is below DrawLabels. In car first-person, labels account for 1449.724 of 1478.381 ms (98.1%).",
    "Walk first-person Sample self time is 452.758 ms, Triangle.Contains 271.650 ms, AddBuilding 181.768 ms and Bin 125.457 ms. Sample inclusive time also contains lazy geometry construction and is not additive with those descendants.",
    "Every sampled getParameter self interval in the moving profiles is under GlState construction. Its inclusive cost is 178.685 ms in walk first-person, 163.142 ms in freeflight and 212.966 ms in walk chase.",
    "Car first-person additionally spends 931.100 ms below BakeTerrainTexture. Camera/simulation/collision paths are much smaller than the first-person rendering preparation paths."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Diagnostic CPU profiles are collected after the timed windows. They identify sampled hot paths but cannot establish the cause or size of a timed-window regression or improvement.",
    "Only one profile per scenario/variant was captured, with movement continuing during profiling; camera position, visibility and cache state differ from the timed window.",
    "Profiles measure main-thread sampled stacks and elapsed sample weights, not GPU/compositor execution, driver deferred work, invocation counts or precise per-call latency.",
    "No explicit managed phase timers or GpuSceneDepth invocation counters exist in these raw captures.",
    "Native helpers and generic AOT extras remain unresolved; their cost is included when they are descendants of a recovered managed method.",
    "The browser environment uses CPU-affined headless Chrome and SwiftShader; these observations are not a hardware-GPU performance guarantee.",
    "Baseline WASM function numbers differ and cannot be compared to candidate numbers without its own exact package mapping. Only the candidate was symbolicated here."
  ]
